meta {
  name: Archive import
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{fhirBase}}/$archive-import
  body: multipartForm
  auth: inherit
}

body:multipart-form {
  file: @file(path/to/archive.zip)
}

docs {
  Uploads a zip archive of FHIR resources for background ingestion. The form field
  must be named `file` (`[FromForm] IFormFile file`). Set the path in the
  `body:multipart-form` block to a real `.zip` on disk before sending. Expect
  `202 Accepted` with an `OperationOutcome` carrying the operation id; progress is
  reported on the operations SignalR hub.

  Scope-gated: requires `operations.import`, and the `AllowImport` feature flag
  must be on. The default token carries no scopes (403 until scoped) — grant the
  scope on the dev client and add it to the **Get token** body, then re-run Get
  token. See the README "Scopes" section.
}
